FUCKIT.md


# claude-code agent runtime: scheduled-tasks state + isolated worktrees
.claude/

# Local-only safety-net backups (e.g., backup of stashes during dir moves)
.scratch/

# Compiled baseline binaries in benchmark-results — these are ELF executables
# that jankurai cannot read as UTF-8 text. Store raw.jsonl/summary.json only.
benchmark-results/sqlite-parity/baselines/**/redlinedb-*

# Volatile CLI backing directories created by memory-mode integration tests.
:memory:/
